---
// Post 9 figure (margin trading): SbP09BoomBustChain
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp9-chain">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 230" role="img" aria-label="Four boxes in order: over 1.5 million new accounts in 2021; margin debt 183 trillion VND at the start of 2022; VN-Index at 947.24 on 10 November 2022, down 37 percent for the year, with 177 stocks at the floor; margin debt about 104 trillion VND at the end of 2022, down 43 percent.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>One boom-and-bust chain, with the figures each source gives</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một chuỗi lên xuống, kèm số liệu từ từng nguồn</tspan></text><rect x="20" y="50" width="185" height="130" rx="10" class="box"/><DiagramIcon name="users" x={50} y={80} size={26} /><text x="34" y="118" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Over 1.5 million</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hơn 1,5 triệu</tspan></text>
      <text x="34" y="136" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>new accounts in 2021</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tài khoản mở mới 2021</tspan></text>
      <text x="34" y="154" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>4.3M+ in total (VSD)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tổng hơn 4,3 triệu (VSD)</tspan></text><line x1="205" y1="115" x2="237" y2="115" class="ln"/><polygon points="245,115 236,110 236,120" class="ah"/><rect x="245" y="50" width="185" height="130" rx="10" class="boxg"/><DiagramIcon name="money" x={275} y={80} size={26} /><text x="259" y="118" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>183 trillion VND</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>183 nghìn tỷ đồng</tspan></text>
      <text x="259" y="136" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>margin debt at 31 brokers,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dư nợ margin 31 CTCK,</tspan></text>
      <text x="259" y="154" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>start of 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đầu năm 2022</tspan></text><line x1="430" y1="115" x2="462" y2="115" class="ln"/><polygon points="470,115 461,110 461,120" class="ah"/><rect x="470" y="50" width="185" height="130" rx="10" class="boxr"/><DiagramIcon name="warning" x={500} y={80} size={26} /><text x="484" y="118" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>−37% year to date</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>−37% từ đầu năm</tspan></text>
      <text x="484" y="136" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>VN-Index 947.24 on</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>VN-Index 947,24 ngày</tspan></text>
      <text x="484" y="154" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>10/11/2022; 177 at floor</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10/11/2022; 177 mã sàn</tspan></text><line x1="655" y1="115" x2="687" y2="115" class="ln"/><polygon points="695,115 686,110 686,120" class="ah"/><rect x="695" y="50" width="185" height="130" rx="10" class="box"/><DiagramIcon name="chart" x={725} y={80} size={26} /><text x="709" y="118" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>About 104 trillion VND</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khoảng 104 nghìn tỷ đồng</tspan></text>
      <text x="709" y="136" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>margin debt at end of</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dư nợ margin cuối</tspan></text>
      <text x="709" y="154" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>2022, down 43%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2022, giảm 43%</tspan></text><text x="20" y="210" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Sources: VSD via Người Quan Sát 08/01/2022; VnEconomy 23/01/2023; Thị trường Tài chính Tiền tệ 11/11/2022.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nguồn: VSD qua Người Quan Sát 08/01/2022; VnEconomy 23/01/2023; Thị trường Tài chính Tiền tệ 11/11/2022.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A sequence from sourced figures. It shows who was on the wire and when; it does not prove that new accounts caused the fall.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một chuỗi từ các số liệu có nguồn. Nó cho thấy ai đứng trên dây và khi nào; không chứng minh tài khoản mới gây ra cú giảm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp9-chain { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp9-chain .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp9-chain svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp9-chain text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp9-chain .h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp9-chain .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp9-chain .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp9-chain .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp9-chain .g { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--act-1); }
  .sbp9-chain .ok { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp9-chain .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp9-chain .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-chain .boxg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-chain .boxok { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-chain .fdebt { fill: var(--border); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp9-chain .feq { fill: var(--act-2); fill-opacity: 0.85; }
  .sbp9-chain .feqr { fill: var(--red); fill-opacity: 0.85; }
  .sbp9-chain .fgold { fill: var(--gold); fill-opacity: 0.9; }
  .sbp9-chain .fgray { fill: var(--text-muted); fill-opacity: 0.55; }
  .sbp9-chain .wh { fill: var(--bg); }
  .sbp9-chain .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-chain .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-chain .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-chain .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .sbp9-chain .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp9-chain .dotr { fill: var(--red); } .sbp9-chain .dotg { fill: var(--gold); } .sbp9-chain .dotk { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp9-chain figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
